P0 — TRAN CUNG THAT LA 10,1 TY, KHONG PHAI 9 TY.
`Config.InitialSupply()` (genesis/config.go:146) chi cong `Allocations` (X/P);
truong `CChainGenesis` nam ngoai vong lap do. A1 phat hanh 1.099.999.999 LOVE9
thang tren C-Chain nen so token do TON TAI nhung `currentSupply` khong bao gio
dem toi. Voi SupplyCap 9e9, du dia mint la 4.699.999.999 thay vi 3.600.000.000
nhu D-042 dinh, va tong LOVE9 toi da tung ton tai la 10.099.999.999 (vuot loi
hua 9 ty 12,2%). Upstream khong vap phai vi Mainnet va Fuji co dung MOT muc
balance trong cChainGenesis, gia tri 0x0 — moi AVAX vao qua X/P.
=> SupplyCap = 7.900.000.001 LOVE9. Bat bien moi:
   SupplyCap + tong(bucket.CChain) == 9.000.000.000

P1 — mustFitSupplyCap tu vo hieu o dung noi no can nhat.
`supplyCap()` doc thang `genesis.A1Params`, bo qua networkID, trong khi
NETWORK_ID la tham so env. NETWORK_ID=9002 cho ra mot genesis doi chieu voi tran
9 ty cua A1 nhung node chay mang 9002 lai dung LocalParams (720 trieu) — tran
nguoc uint64 o reward/calculator.go. Nay doc qua
`genesis.GetStakingConfig(networkID)`, va netgen tu choi thang moi networkID
khac 9001.

P1 — A1 khong so huu lich nang cap.
`upgrade.GetConfig` chi tach Mainnet va Fuji; 9001 roi vao `Default` cua Ava
Labs. Hom nay vo hai, nhung khi upstream len lich Helicon thi luot rebase ke
tiep se nuot tron mot hard fork khong qua quyet dinh nao. Them `upgrade.A1`,
chep tuong minh tu Default — GIA TRI Y HET, cai doi la QUYEN chu khong phai
hanh vi.

P1 — HRP song bang FALLBACK, va mang khong co ten.
9001 khong co trong `NetworkIDToHRP` nen `GetHRP` roi xuong `FallbackHRP`. Mot
luot rebase dat lai no ve "custom" la doi tien to MOI dia chi P/X da phat ra
ngoai, va khong cong nao bat duoc. Nay khai tuong minh `A1HRP`, them `A1Name`
va `A1ID`.
[!] `A1Name` DOI DUONG DAN DB (config/config.go dung NetworkName de dung
`<db-dir>/<ten mang>`): binary mang ten nay CHI duoc dua len cung mot luot sinh
lai mang. Dua len mang dang chay ma khong wipe thi ca 9 node cung luc thay DB
trong.

P2 — ba cong khac chu lech chinh chuan cua no.
  - `verifyAgainstC1` chi `strings.Contains` ca tep, nen chung minh duoc "byte
    thuoc bo cua C1" chu khong phai "dung tai lieu nao". Nay doi chieu theo TUNG
    tai lieu: hash phai cung dong voi ten tep hoac id.
  - thieu `A1_ENGRAVE_CHECKSUMS` chi CANH BAO roi khac tiep. Nay CHAN; luot tap
    khai `A1_ENGRAVE_NO_CHECKSUMS=toi-biet-day-la-ban-tap`.
  - khong cong nao canh mat `p`: manifest thieu mat goc thi khac mot BO RONG vao
    P-Chain, im lang. Nay chan.

Nghiem thu (container golang, mount fork):
  go vet + go build  : sach
  netgen N=9 9001    : X/P 4.300.000.001 <= tran 7.900.000.001 ·
                       tran + C-Chain = 9.000.000.000 · du dia mint 3.600.000.000
  genesis sinh ra    : 6 alloc · 9 staker · offset 604800 · chainId 9000000009 ·
                       X/P 4.300.000.001 + C-Chain 1.099.999.999 = 5.400.000.000

Doi chung nguoc — 5/5 do dung cho:
  NETWORK_ID=9002              -> FATAL
  SupplyCap dat lai 9e9        -> FATAL ke toan, in ra 10.099.999.999
  thieu CHECKSUMS              -> FATAL (truoc: chi canh bao)
  CHECKSUMS gan nham ten tep   -> FATAL (truoc: CHO QUA)
  manifest khong co mat 'p'    -> FATAL (truoc: khac bo rong)

[!] Doi chung nguoc bat duoc mot loi trong chinh thong bao moi: thieu tham so
`networkID` trong Fprintf, ra "%!d(string=...)" va cac con so in lech cot. Cong
van CHAN dung, nhung nguoi doc no se bi dan sai. Da sua; `go vet` cung bat duoc
— nen tu nay chay vet truoc khi tin mot thong bao loi.

